Z||000000||pHoOl||11-13-2001||04:26 PM||||First off...  What is "double clutching"?  I've heard the term used before, but since i drive an auto, i obviously can't apply it.  Usually this is said in contrast to "granny shifting".  <P>Second... <BR>What is the difference between a wet and dry nitrous kit?<P>Thanks for educating me!<P>------------------<BR>Kills:<BR>97 Neon R/T<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>         <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/phoolsig2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||11-13-2001||04:37 PM||||Here are some sites with good double clutching info<BR> <A HREF="http://driversedge.com/dblcltch.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://driversedge.com/dblcltch.htm</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://integra.vtec.net/driving/dclutch.html" TARGET=_blank>http://integra.vtec.net/driving/dclutch.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://happytogether.com/318ti/notebook/shifting/" TARGET=_blank>http://happytogether.com/318ti/notebook/shifting/</A> <P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||7
Z||000002||88CoupeV6||11-13-2001||04:53 PM||||A wet system sprays both fuel and Nitrous through a nozzle. A dry system sprays just the Nitrous and needs the cars fuel injectors to get tricked into supplying more fuel to compensate for the nitrous||||reg||1
Z||000003||pHoOl||11-13-2001||05:07 PM||||where does the spray go into?  i guess i always assumed it would spray the nitrous into the intake at some point, but not sure where.  All this reading about double clutching is making me want a stick!<P>------------------<BR>Kills:<BR>97 Neon R/T<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>         <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/phoolsig2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||88CoupeV6||11-13-2001||05:54 PM||||In the NOS book I have it states that the nozzle is usually placed 3"-4" before the throttle body.||||reg||1
Z||000005||88CoupeV6||11-13-2001||05:58 PM||||All the clutching sounds like it is complex but becomes second nature after a wile. I will only get stick cars. I used to have auto's but I find nothing compares to the feel of a stick. I think it is too much fun.||||reg||10
